      "text": "Mosk pointed firmly at the door, but Lina reached into her pocket and pulled out the last apple of the season. She set the crisp fruit on the step between them and whispered that this was for the trouble of walking her down. Mosk stared at the apple for a long time, his grey ears twitching. Finally, he stood up, straightened his patched vest, and stepped onto the first stair without saying a word."
